    "Effort estimates include design, coding, unit testing, and basic integration testing, but exclude full system testing and deployment.",
    "Existing CI infrastructure or organizational accounts are available to set up the pipelines.",
    "The investigation of PHD porting will result in a documented approach and a basic prototype, not a fully production-ready implementation."
  ],
  "activities": [
